Rule 1 (argument must be a TF tensor; suppresses InvalidArgumentError)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_1)
>>
Rule 2 (all dimensions are non-negative when rank > 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 3 (safe shape access guarded by rank)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 0)
>>
Rule 4 (min/max only required for non-empty tensors)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ∃j ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, j) = 0 then true else min(v_1) ≤ max(v_1)
>>
Rule 5 (rank is an integer-valued quantity)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) % 1 = 0
